# V13 plan rewrite — legible journey

Coordinate: 18.6.12/8.7.12/6.6.10
Issued: 2026-11-06 17:24 CST
Request (verbatim): V11 and V12 have lost the plot with respect to animation. V10 is clearly superior. Rewrite the plan for V13. Make sure the journey across semantic space is legible to the viewer.
