Notes:
- Diagnosis from the build records: V11 kept V10's optics (SUBN, DOF) and discarded its kinematics (fixed camera, no head-tracking, no chapters, no signal dynamics); V12's color hush alone could not restore the journey.
- Ruling recorded as feedback corpus section 7.13 (63 items); film skill gained a v13 row and the legibility law; skills.phext rebuilt; synced to emise-tools @ 0f297031 (verified hashes + modes).

Results:
- Plan: ~/workspace/goals/wavefront-film-v11-choir-collaborative-build/files/v13-plan-legible-journey.md — V11's Singular Journey data filmed with V10's animation grammar; legibility specified as four viewer questions; V12 master superseded, not dispatched.
# Read Steve Ruiz tweet: 'find all of the implicit state machines in my app'

