# Modernize phcc: UML enhancements + provably correct C

Coordinate: 24.5.7/7.6.10/5.5.7
Issued: 2026-11-07
Request (verbatim): Let's focus on modernizing phcc - apply real enhancements from UML. Let's also make it provably correct C - a C compiler that won't let you ship broken code.
Status: MERGED + PUBLISHED (wbic16/phcc main=exo=7573c4b8): canonical phcc.phext 646144c7… (52,815 scrolls) = consolidated base + Slice 5 machine #2 (34 scrolls) + hardened receipts transplant (4 Proofs scrolls, WP 271/297, no STALE), gate v5 verdict regenerated + byte-reproducible; fresh clone: unpack 558/558 verified, ALL TESTS PASSED. All slices, consolidation, pack/unpack, parity library, D-2 resolution published. Open threads: proof-hardening continuation (branch-E stones / h7); design machines #3 linker, #4 register allocation.

Notes:
- Two thrusts: (1) real UML enhancements via the 6D UML phext layer, (2) provably correct C with a tiered ship gate.
- Framing given to Will: three separate claims (compiler correctness / verified user code / proof artifacts in phext) must not be conflated; CompCert-scale compiler verification flagged as multi-year, out of first scope.
- Slice 5 COMPLETE 2026-11-07 (task 42.4.6/5.5.11/7.5.11): design A.3 machines #1 (Slice 4, preprocessor) and #2 (Slice 5, value stack) are both built and registered. Remaining on the design Later list: machine #3 (linker, Book 5) and machine #4 (register allocation, Book 6).
- 2026-11-07: machine #4 (register allocation, Slice 7, task 49.3.6/4.4.12/5.3.10) complete — see that task. Machines #1 (Slice 4), #2 (Slice 5), #4 (Slice 7) done; #3 (linker, Slice 6) sibling in flight at last check.

Results:
- Slice 2 phext SHA-256 5fe2bd50… (9,167,249 B); report ~/workspace/phcc-slice2/REPORT.md.
- [2026-11-07 consolidation] Two phext lineages merged into one canonical phcc.phext (A phases + B v4 Vol 3; full diff proof; Design views regenerated 196 identical / 109 own-members / 46 universe-only; gate v4 tables byte-identical to A baseline, verdict reproducible) and pushed to wbic16/phcc (5cd3ad91); monolith.phext deleted from repo in 4f974464 after need-check (not a build input; contents = phcc.phext Vol 1, 319/319). Final tips main = exo = 4f974464.
