- Wave D5 published-in-stack 2026-11-08 (local, not pushed): F32 bswap, F33 __auto_type, F34 _Float128 codegen (completes F29) + refresh b8976f64 on base 88806a61. Conformance 330/333 (b_gnu_009, b_gnu_020 closed). F34 completed under a takeover after the first agent ended without a report; four WIP defects found by audit and fixed in-commit (see PATCHES F34).
