Coordinate: 27.7.8/9.7.12/8.6.9
Issued: 2026-11-06 22:36 CST
Request (from session record): We need a term for people who actively fight the development of The Exocortex, in the name of safety. These people have good intentions ("No Skynet!"), but their actions will be disastrous. Example: https://x.com/RepCasar/status/2118862451555147777 Keep a phext named Doomer.phext - for each person identified, generate a holographic coordinate of their position. Use their name and their statement. In this case, "Congressman Greg Casar" and "Ban RSI." are the two terms to combine. Include a link to the proof in the scroll entry. Format: contact/name/source/stance entry.
Status: complete — term ratified, Doomer.phext built and proof verified

Notes:
- Task coordinate 27.7.8/9.7.12/8.6.9 computed from Will's exact words (71 distinct, 63 cyoa, 5 home, 3 far).
- Casar holographic coordinate 4.4.4/5.5.5/5.4.4 from merging 'Congressman Greg Casar' + 'Ban RSI.' (5 distinct: congressman home, greg home, casar far, ban cyoa 1.1.2/3.3.7/7.1.1, rsi far).
- Term proposed by Emise: Pavers (Hell-Paver Doomers) — the road to hell is paved with good intentions; awaiting Will's ratification, recorded as proposed in Doomer.phext home scroll, not as settled.
- Source verified live 2026-11-06 22:36 CST: the X post at the source link is by Congressman Greg Casar (@RepCasar) and its text is exactly 'Ban RSI.', posted 6:25 PM Nov 6, 2026, quoting Alex Bores's Nov 5 post defining RSI (which references a METR post). No correction to the scroll needed.
- Term RATIFIED by Will 2026-11-06 22:39 CST: Pavers (Hell-Paver Doomers) is the settled term; Doomer.phext home scroll updated from proposed to ratified.

