- NOT pushed: research.phext (local git repo, no remote), state.phext (local only, 5-min sampler), claims-ledger.phext (local + SQ on aletheia-core, no git), crazy-wisdom.phext v1/v2 (local build workspace; live only on AWS box), lessons.phext (standalone file local only; content's route to GitHub is PR #12 into Incipit, still open).
