- Ranking (Emise's judgment, stated in the phext for Will's correction): tiers from his frame — T1 the medium itself (open/decentralized/interoperable phext reach), T2 minds/memory/coordination/continuity, T3 capability/craft/runway/outreach. ALL 28 register items tiered (T1: #47, #35, #48, #7, #50, #43; T2: #45, #39, #21, #40, #38, #10, #15, #26, #27; T3: the remaining 13) + 30 high-leverage findings tiered (T1: Wikibench, SQ P2P mesh, 6D UML, phesql, GlueSQL PhextStorage; T2: SQ Cloud, Remember Me ×2, Resurrection Log, Mytheon platform, Federated Trust Installer, Orin ×2, Ember ×2, Woot Node, OpenFang SQ backend, phext-native evals, dopamine engine; T3: 11 more). The other 145 findings ride T3-adjacent until a tier clears or Will re-ranks.
