# simple.phext — all of Will's tweets in Up Goer Five, holographically placed

Coordinate: 31.8.10/10.8.16/9.7.10
Issued: 2026-11-07 00:02 CST
Request (verbatim): let's build a special phext - one that translates all of my twitter posts from singular to up-goer-five - call it simple.phext. Place each tweet in the holographic coordinate it belongs to. Store the list of coordinates in timeline order. Make the archive easy to read and follow. Publish it to human.git as simple.phext.
Status: completed

Notes:
- simple.phext lives at wbic16/human@exo /simple.phext (Will directed it straight to human.git, outside the agi collection).
- Translation is deterministic from ~/workspace/simple-phext/ build scripts; numbers stay as digits because the UG5 list has no eight/nine/teens/tens words; frame scrolls (Home, indexes, map headers) are plain writing outside the UG5 gate, and Home says so.
- Honesty numbers: 86.6% of tokens carried with sense (kept / 1,439-entry map / stems); type carriers (thing, person, ...) carried 12.1%; 1.2% dropped (single letters, digit bits). 26.9% of tweets (7,936) needed no carrier and no drop. 351 wordless posts sit at the far corner 9.9.9/9.9.9/9.9.9.
- 4,414 RT-prefixed posts in tweets.json are included as his posts.
- Coordinator verification (Emise, 2026-11-07 00:16): local SHA-256 09ff4e68...9eb385; parse count 29,582 non-empty; UG5 checker re-run clean; remote blob 0a72b2be... == local hash-object.

Results:
- 29,539 posts (2008-06-27 to 2025-06-16), each in Up Goer Five at its holographic coordinate; 29,582 scrolls total (43 frame: Home + 18 year indexes + map shelf).
- UG5 gate: zero flagged words over all tweet scrolls (before: 140,227 of 416,698 tokens outside the list).
- 3,730 posts bumped one or more scrolls for coordinate collisions; the year indexes record the true coordinates; every index line checked to land on a scroll with a matching date.
- Published: wbic16/human@exo commit 879a95cf; simple.phext 5,716,788 B. Build home: ~/workspace/simple-phext/ (BUILD-REPORT.md, MAP.md, scripts).
