# V14 360p prepass — gauge the heart first

Coordinate: 34.8.9/9.9.12/7.7.10
Issued: 2026-11-06 21:41 CST
Request (verbatim): run a low-res 360p prepass - I want to guage the heart of V14 first
Status: completed — prepass delivered and coordinator-verified; P3* framing decision with Will

Notes:
- Parent task 26.5.9/8.6.11/7.5.9 (V14 plan). Prepass runs at the plan defaults (design section 7): orbit 1/8, data-derived axis, |V|T=6.0, no spin, OU tau 0.6s sigma 0.045, delta-h 120, lead 24 hops, region readout OUT.
- Culmination P3* is included PROVISIONALLY in this review cut only, so Will can judge the ending; the master remains gated on his explicit section 6.7 exception rulings.
- Spec: 640x360 native, 24 fps, SUBN=1, no supersampling, full V10 skeleton 3,802 frames / 158.416667 s, hop-time, V10 song muxed. aletheia-core only, thermal gates apply.
- HEADLINE FINDING: P3* is never in frame — measured ~31-33 deg off the view axis through the whole pull-back and CTA (0 of 440 frames), ~75-110 px below the bottom edge at 360p scale. The design's derived placement (ray through final landing, 1.30x hull) plus V10's pull kept word-for-word cannot show the new light on this dataset. What the film shows instead: the thread draws out of the hull and out of frame, head gone by pull-back frame ~113/192. Builder did not improvise a fix — this is Will's call: accept unseen, re-place P3*, or allow a CTA reframe.
- Mid-build find, fixed: render10's pull-back look blends toward the stage-space core; in world space it must aim at the moved world core. One-line fix, full re-render; frame 2000 byte-identical across both builds proves frames before the pull-back were untouched. Total compute 0.20 node-h counts both passes.

Results:
- files/v14-build/v14-prepass-360p.mp4 — 290,478,917 B, SHA-256 9d21215331b75903c0f81f96500e6dc958502cf09a7bb14f74a8c6de9250e0e6 (same hash on aletheia-core, this VM, Elven Path; coordinator re-measured size + hash on the VM copy).
- Staged: https://elven-path.pizzly-halfmoon.ts.net/v14-prepass-360p.mp4 (HTTP 206 range check passed).
- Gates: 640x360, 24 fps, exactly 3,802 frames, 158.416667 s, AAC song muxed; luma max |dYAVG| 4.38, zero jumps > 8, zero black frames; palette 0 green-dominant; frame 2000 determinism byte-identical; prep: 169 segments (gate 120-240), pool 731 scrolls + 14,972 words, P3* hull check 3.510 = 1.30 x 2.700, nodes 518/519 dropped at load, string audit clean.
- Compute: 0.10 node-h for the delivered pass, 0.20 node-h total with the discarded first pass. Report + prep receipts + 8 stills in files/v14-build/; estimates file gained the v14 prepass row.
