Notes:
- Follows the phext-notepad perf pass (28.6.11/8.7.12/6.6.9): libphext-rs 0.3.1 explode proven quadratic there; Will directed fixing the libraries at the source, libphext-cs first.
- FOUND AT INTAKE (verified via GitHub API 2026-11-08): wbic16/libphext-cs ALREADY carries a branch 'linear-tokenize' @ 750928855e34 — exactly 1 commit ahead of exo @ 8e7e485c22c4, 0 behind — commit 'Phokenize in linear time' (Phokenize called NextScroll in a loop, and NextScroll re-encod...). Unmerged. The task is therefore: audit that commit, verify it (tests + equivalence + benchmark on agi.phext), and land it if it passes.
